      "message": "because it makes an error with this lambda:\n error: invalid user-defined conversion from ‘main(int, char**)::\u003clambda(WGPURequestAdapterStatus, WGPUAdapter, const char*, void*)\u003e’ to ‘wgpu::RequestAdapterCallback’ {aka ‘void (*)",
